<div class="pad"></div>
<div class="pad"></div>Here we are picking up the Tier 11 chest <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=60344/reinforced-sapphirium-battleplate">
<img alt="Reinforced Sapphirium Battleplate" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_plate_raidpaladin_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Reinforced Sapphirium Battleplate</span></a> as our last tier item, with the assumption that we will be crafting the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=55060/elementium-deathplate">
<img alt="Elementium Deathplate" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_plate_raidwarrior_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Elementium Deathplate</span></a>. We will also not be getting the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=58185/band-of-bees">
<img alt="Band of Bees" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_pearlring1.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Band of Bees</span></a> early, as there are many solid rings at the 346 item level and haste is not a particularly great stat. Our absolute last priority is <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=64674/relic-of-aggramar">
<img alt="Relic of Aggramar" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_stone_15.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Relic of Aggramar</span></a> as it is not best in slot for Phase 1. After you pick up the Tier 11 items, the rest is very flexible and you can fill in the gaps wherever your set is the weakest. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=58195/woe-breeders-boots">
<img alt="Woe Breeder's Boots" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_raidwarrior_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Woe Breeder's Boots</span></a> is bind-on-equip so instead of paying 1650 <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a> for them, you can simply buy them on an alt character and mail them to your main, or you can buy them on the auction house instead. These are a low priority purchase due to this, but also because they have zero mastery and aren't that much better than <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62418/boots-of-sullen-rock">
<img alt="Boots of Sullen Rock" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_plate_raiddeathknight_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Boots of Sullen Rock</span></a>. That being said, due to being bind-on-equip you can get these before the first raid. You will be able to get 3200 <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a> before the first raid, which means you can really only afford to get <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=60347/reinforced-sapphirium-legplates">
<img alt="Reinforced Sapphirium Legplates" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_plate_raidpaladin_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Reinforced Sapphirium Legplates</span></a>, after which you will save up for the next piece of tier <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=60345/reinforced-sapphirium-gauntlets">
<img alt="Reinforced Sapphirium Gauntlets" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlets_plate_raidpaladin_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Reinforced Sapphirium Gauntlets</span></a>. So for this pre-raid best in slot set, we will include <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=60347/reinforced-sapphirium-legplates">
<img alt="Reinforced Sapphirium Legplates" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_plate_raidpaladin_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Reinforced Sapphirium Legplates</span></a>. <br/>
<br/>
