<br/>
<br/>
<b>
<i>If you are a Human or Draenei and need to drop hit due to <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=6562/heroic-presence">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_21.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Heroic Presence</span></a> or drop expertise due to <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=20597/sword-specialization">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_meleedamage.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sword Specialization</span></a>, simply reforge your gear to decrease them and get as close to your caps as possible. Only so much of these excess stats can be reforged, and sometimes you will have to accept that part of your racial bonus will be wasted. There doesn't seem to be any item swaps that make more sense than simply reforging your stats. </i></b>
<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="body-armor">Body Armor for Retribution Paladin DPS</h3>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="head-for-retribution-paladin-dps">Head for Retribution Paladin DPS</h4>The best headpiece is certainly <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=59359/reinforced-bio-optic-killshades">
<img alt="Reinforced Bio-Optic Killshades" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gizmo_newgoggles.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Reinforced Bio-Optic Killshades</span></a> for Engineers, which allows you to use Cogwheel gems for a large amount of secondary stats, and Engineering is a best-in-slot profession throughout Cataclysm for Retribution. For non-Engineers, the other three helms are pretty close with <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56278/anomuran-helm">
<img alt="Anomuran Helm" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_plate_dungeonplate_c_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Anomuran Helm</span></a> being the best. The Cogwheel gems are unique-equipped, so you can only have 1 per stat - this means you should use Mastery/<wbr/>Hit or Mastery/<wbr/>Expertise or even Hit/<wbr/>Expertise depending on what you need most. <br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Helm Enchant</b>: <a class="q7 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62422/arcanum-of-the-wildhammer">
<img alt="Arcanum of the Wildhammer" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_fire_masterofelements.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Arcanum of the Wildhammer</span></a> or <a class="q7 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62368/arcanum-of-the-dragonmaw">
<img alt="Arcanum of the Dragonmaw" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_fire_masterofelements.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Arcanum of the Dragonmaw</span></a>, requires Revered reputation with <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/faction=1172/dragonmaw-clan">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Dragonmaw Clan</span></a> or <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/faction=1174/wildhammer-clan">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Wildhammer Clan</span></a>.<div class="pad"></div>
<table class="grid max-width">
<tbody>
<tr>
<td data-background="c4" style="width: 10%; max-width: 100%;">
<b>Rank</b></td>
<td data-background="c4" style="width: 25%; max-width: 100%;">
<b>Item</b></td>
<td data-background="c4" style="width: 20%; max-width: 100%;">
<b>Sockets</b></td>
<td data-background="c4" style="width: 23%; max-width: 100%;">
<b>Source</b></td>
<td data-background="c4" style="width: 22%; max-width: 100%;">
<b>Location</b></td></tr>
<tr>
<td>Best: Engineer</td>
<td>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=59359/reinforced-bio-optic-killshades">
<img alt="Reinforced Bio-Optic Killshades" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gizmo_newgoggles.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Reinforced Bio-Optic Killshades</span></a></td>
<td>
