<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="shoulders-for-retribution-paladin-dps">Shoulders for Retribution Paladin DPS</h4>For the pre-raid best in slot, we will be utilizing the 2-set Vicious Gladiator set bonus for +70 Strength, which also gives us the glove bonus (+5% increased <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=35395/crusader-strike">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_crusaderstrike.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Crusader Strike</span></a> damage). These pieces are very easy to farm, as you can get the required <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=390/conquest-points">
<span>
<img alt="Conquest Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvpcurrency-conquest-horde.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Conquest Points</span></span></a> extremely quickly through arena or rated battlegrounds. Thus, we will be using <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=60417/vicious-gladiators-scaled-shoulders">
<img alt="Vicious Gladiator's Scaled Shoulders" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_plate_pvppaladin_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Vicious Gladiator's Scaled Shoulders</span></a> in the shoulder slot. There is no minimum rating requirement for these items. The best non-PvP shoulder option is <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56318/razs-pauldrons">
<img alt="Raz's Pauldrons" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_plate_dungeonplate_c_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Raz's Pauldrons</span></a> from <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=4926/blackrock-caverns">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Blackrock Caverns</span></a>, but there are a few good alternatives with 346 item level: <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=58100/pauldrons-of-the-high-requiem">
<img alt="Pauldrons of the High Requiem" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_plate_dungeonplate_c_04.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Pauldrons of the High Requiem</span></a> and <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=63470/missing-diplomats-pauldrons">
<img alt="Missing Diplomat's Pauldrons" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_plate_dungeonplate_c_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Missing Diplomat's Pauldrons</span></a> can be interchanged as necessary and reforged as necessary to meet hit and expertise caps.<br/>
<br/>
<i>Note: Currently the <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=390/conquest-points">
<span>
<img alt="Conquest Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvpcurrency-conquest-horde.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Conquest Points</span></span></a> vendors are not available due to a bug, but hopefully they will return soon so you can have these pieces before raid. </i>
<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Shoulder Enchant</b>: <a class="q7 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62345/greater-inscription-of-jagged-stone">
<img alt="Greater Inscription of Jagged Stone" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_gem_emeraldrough_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Greater Inscription of Jagged Stone</span></a>, requires Exalted reputation with <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/faction=1171/therazane">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Therazane</span></a>.<div class="pad"></div>
