<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="back-for-retribution-paladin-dps">Back for Retribution Paladin DPS</h4>
<a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56397/geordans-cloak">
<img alt="Geordan's Cloak" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_cataclysm_melee_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Geordan's Cloak</span></a> might not be the highest item level, but it gives us the most relevant stats to our early gearing. Since you will likely be getting <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/faction=1158/guardians-of-hyjal">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Guardians of Hyjal</span></a> reputation first, you can pick up <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62383/wrap-of-the-great-turtle">
<img alt="Wrap of the Great Turtle" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_cataclysm_tank_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Wrap of the Great Turtle</span></a> early on, which is very powerful when reforged - despite being a tank cloak - until you are able to pick up something better. If you are rich and want to buy <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=67140/drape-of-inimitable-fate">
<img alt="Drape of Inimitable Fate" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_cataclysm_tank_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Drape of Inimitable Fate</span></a>, it is the better item in this specific set, due to being able to replace lost hit rating with our tier legs from valor points. <br/>
<br/>The best enchant is <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=75178/swordguard-embroidery">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_thread_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Swordguard Embroidery</span></a>, making Tailoring a best in slot profession for Phase 1, otherwise the best enchant is <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74247/enchant-cloak-greater-critical-strike">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulagood_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Cloak - Greater Critical Strike</span></a>. Until you can get required <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=52722/maelstrom-crystal">
<img alt="Maelstrom Crystal" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_crystalepic.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Maelstrom Crystal</span></a> for this, the next best enchant is <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74230/enchant-cloak-critical-strike">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Cloak - Critical Strike</span></a>. <br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Back Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=75178/swordguard-embroidery">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_thread_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Swordguard Embroidery</span></a> for Tailors, otherwise <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74247/enchant-cloak-greater-critical-strike">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulagood_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Cloak - Greater Critical Strike</span></a> &gt; <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74230/enchant-cloak-critical-strike">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Cloak - Critical Strike</span></a>.<div class="pad"></div>
