<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="gloves-for-retribution-paladin-dps">Gloves for Retribution Paladin DPS</h4>For the pre-raid best in slot, we will be utilizing the 2-set Vicious Gladiator set bonus for +70 Strength, which also gives us the glove bonus (+5% increased <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=35395/crusader-strike">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_crusaderstrike.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Crusader Strike</span></a> damage). These pieces are very easy to farm, as you can get the required <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=390/conquest-points">
<span>
<img alt="Conquest Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvpcurrency-conquest-horde.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Conquest Points</span></span></a> extremely quickly through arena or rated battlegrounds. Thus, we will be using <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=60414/vicious-gladiators-scaled-gauntlets">
<img alt="Vicious Gladiator's Scaled Gauntlets" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_glove_plate_pvppaladin_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Vicious Gladiator's Scaled Gauntlets</span></a> in the glove slot. There is no minimum rating requirement for these items. For non-PvP options, <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=58099/reaping-gauntlets">
<img alt="Reaping Gauntlets" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlets_plate_dungeonplate_c_04.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Reaping Gauntlets</span></a> have the best stats and cost <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=395/justice-points">
<span>
<img alt="Justice Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-justice.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Justice Points</span></span></a>, so they should be an easy pick up. If you get one of the other, similar gloves like <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=63474/gear-marked-gauntlets">
<img alt="Gear-Marked Gauntlets" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_glove_plate_dungeonplate_c_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Gear-Marked Gauntlets</span></a> first you can hold off on buying them and instead spend your <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=395/justice-points">
<span>
<img alt="Justice Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-justice.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Justice Points</span></span></a> on other items first.<br/>
<br/>Until you are able to secure the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=52722/maelstrom-crystal">
<img alt="Maelstrom Crystal" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_crystalepic.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Maelstrom Crystal</span></a> for <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74254/enchant-gloves-mighty-strength">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulagood_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Gloves - Mighty Strength</span></a>, the best option will be <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74212/enchant-gloves-exceptional-strength">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Gloves - Exceptional Strength</span></a>. <br/>
<br/>
<i>Note: Currently the <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=390/conquest-points">
<span>
<img alt="Conquest Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvpcurrency-conquest-horde.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Conquest Points</span></span></a> vendors are not available due to a bug, but hopefully they will return soon so you can have these pieces before raid. </i>
<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Gloves Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74254/enchant-gloves-mighty-strength">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulagood_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Gloves - Mighty Strength</span></a> &gt; <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74212/enchant-gloves-exceptional-strength">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Gloves - Exceptional Strength</span></a> , plus <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=82175/synapse-springs">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Synapse Springs</span></a> (<i>Engineers only</i>).<div class="pad"></div>
