<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="legs-for-retribution-paladin-dps">Legs for Retribution Paladin DPS</h4>As soon as you are able, you should spend your <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a> on your Tier 11 legs <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=60347/reinforced-sapphirium-legplates">
<img alt="Reinforced Sapphirium Legplates" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_plate_raidpaladin_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Reinforced Sapphirium Legplates</span></a>. You can get these before the first raid reset. Not a lot of options here, <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56367/legguards-of-winnowing-wind">
<img alt="Legguards of Winnowing Wind" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_plate_dungeonplate_c_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Legguards of Winnowing Wind</span></a> have the best stat budget before you can get your valor tier pants, try to get them as soon as possible, and this way you won't have to waste <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=395/justice-points">
<span>
<img alt="Justice Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-justice.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Justice Points</span></span></a> on <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=58097/greaves-of-gallantry">
<img alt="Greaves of Gallantry" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_plate_dungeonplate_c_04.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Greaves of Gallantry</span></a>. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=67141/corefire-legplates">
<img alt="Corefire Legplates" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_plate_raidwarrior_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Corefire Legplates</span></a> are not really worth paying for, as you will immediately replace them with <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=60347/reinforced-sapphirium-legplates">
<img alt="Reinforced Sapphirium Legplates" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_plate_raidpaladin_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Reinforced Sapphirium Legplates</span></a> and they have haste, as well as zero mastery - so these aren't the most ideal stats for us. <br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Legs Enchant</b>: <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56550/dragonscale-leg-armor">
<img alt="Dragonscale Leg Armor" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_monsterscales_14.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Dragonscale Leg Armor</span></a>.<div class="pad"></div>
