<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="boots-for-retribution-paladin-dps">Boots for Retribution Paladin DPS</h4>There is a pair of high item level bind-on-equip <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a> boots <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=58195/woe-breeders-boots">
<img alt="Woe Breeder's Boots" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_raidwarrior_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Woe Breeder's Boots</span></a> - these can be obtained before the first raid by buying them on the auction house or spending <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a> on an alt character - I would not recommend spending the points on your main character, as you should be buying tier legs instead. The second-best boots here is a pair of tank boots <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62418/boots-of-sullen-rock">
<img alt="Boots of Sullen Rock" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_plate_raiddeathknight_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Boots of Sullen Rock</span></a>. There is not a lot of options below this point, <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56381/greaves-of-wu-the-elder">
<img alt="Greaves of Wu the Elder" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_plate_dungeonplate_c_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Greaves of Wu the Elder</span></a> have hit, allowing better gearing in other places. If you grind <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/faction=1158/guardians-of-hyjal">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Guardians of Hyjal</span></a> reputation early, then you can pick up <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62382/waywatchers-boots">
<img alt="Waywatcher's Boots" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_plate_dungeonplate_c_04.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Waywatcher's Boots</span></a> in the meantime. <br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Boot Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74236/enchant-boots-precision">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Boots - Precision</span></a> or <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74238/enchant-boots-mastery">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Boots - Mastery</span></a>.<div class="pad"></div>
