<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="rings-for-retribution-paladin-dps">Rings for Retribution Paladin DPS</h4>The ring slot is very flexible and here listed below are many options that are all very similar, with the exception of the expensive best in slot BoE world drop <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=67139/blauvelts-family-crest">
<img alt="Blauvelt's Family Crest" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_diamondring1.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Blauvelt's Family Crest</span></a>. You can swap them around freely to meet your hit and expertise needs in order to reach the caps, reforging as necessary, until you are able to get the best in slot rings. Take whatever 346 item level options you can get early on in the phase, then min-max your ring selection later. If you can't afford <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=67139/blauvelts-family-crest">
<img alt="Blauvelt's Family Crest" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_diamondring1.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Blauvelt's Family Crest</span></a> and don't need hit from <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56415/nova-band">
<img alt="Nova Band" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_51naxxramas.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Nova Band</span></a> or expertise from <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56365/skyshard-ring">
<img alt="Skyshard Ring" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_kingsring2.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Skyshard Ring</span></a> then your next best option is <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56388/ring-of-the-darkest-day">
<img alt="Ring of the Darkest Day" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_54.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ring of the Darkest Day</span></a>. <br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Ring Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74215/enchant-ring-strength">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Ring - Strength</span></a> (<i>enchanters only</i>).<div class="pad"></div>
