<h5 class="heading-size-5" id="passive-trinkets">Passive Trinkets</h5>
<a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56393/heart-of-solace">
<img alt="Heart of Solace" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_persecution.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Heart of Solace</span></a> is by far the best option here, and pretty easy to acquire to boot. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62049/darkmoon-card-hurricane">
<img alt="Darkmoon Card: Hurricane" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_inscription_tarot_hurricanecard.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Darkmoon Card: Hurricane</span></a> costs a few thousand gold on most servers and performs a bit worse, and additionally doesn't really scale as you gain more gear, thus it's not generally recommended. If you are an Alchemist, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=68775/volatile-alchemist-stone">
<img alt="Volatile Alchemist Stone" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/item_alchemiststoneb.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Volatile Alchemist Stone</span></a> can be an early option before you pick up <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56393/heart-of-solace">
<img alt="Heart of Solace" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_persecution.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Heart of Solace</span></a>. <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56431/right-eye-of-rajh">
<img alt="Right Eye of Rajh" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_dragonseye02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Right Eye of Rajh</span></a> is the worst option here due to only having a 10 second duration, thus the likelihood it lines up with your cooldowns is very poor.<div class="pad"></div>
