<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="librams-for-retribution-paladin-dps">Librams for Retribution Paladin DPS</h4>
<a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62243/notched-jawbone">
<img alt="Notched Jawbone" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_trinket_06.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Notched Jawbone</span></a> is not only our pre-raid best in slot due to the mastery + hit combination, but is also Phase 1 best in slot, so pick this up when you can. The materials might be expensive early in the phase, so you might want to pick up one of the other relic options to tide you over until you can afford it.<div class="pad"></div>
